<title>FRANCE: EU raises daily wheat export refund to Switzerland.</title>
<headline>EU raises daily wheat export refund to Switzerland.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union raised the daily refund applying to soft wheat exports to Switzerland to nine Ecus per tonne from five Ecus, France's grain office ONIC said on Friday.</p>
<p>The EU also raised the refund for barley exports to Switzerland to 19.00 Ecus per tonne from 18.50 Ecus, it said.</p>
<p>The EU kept the refund applying to rye exports to Switzerland unchanged at 22.00 Ecus per tonne.</p>
<p>The EU's grain panel took the decisions at its weekly meeting on Thursday.</p>
</text>
